  "note": "SPEC-058 R-68 – R-70: the music cases both readers run, Arke Player arke_world (Dart) and ArkeStudio contracts (TypeScript). A \"music\" case is a music document read against assets.json: \"kind\" and \"tracks\" list what an ok case reads, \"sections\" the first track's sections. A \"manifest\" case is a world.json: \"alone\" and \"music\" are what an ok one names.",
